window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-042-d0dccd1096a56ee8.json"]={sha256:"d0dccd1096a56ee8fe56fe72c3e61b6908970f9be1a3a8dd7ff5b65ac5a8ede1",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-b5275ae878ccc1e5","url":"https://instinct.docs.amd.com/projects/dc-design/latest/index.html","title":"Data Center Design Guide","titleEn":"Data Center Design Guide","publisher":"AMD","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-042","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-042","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-043","referenceUrls":["https://www.opencompute.org/documents/oai-system-liquid-cooling-guidelines-in-ocp-template-mar-3-2023-update-pdf"],"title":"OCP 歧管：平行冷卻支路的阻力不均","titleEn":"OCP manifolds: resistance imbalance in parallel cooling branches","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付元件熱帳本、雙路徑守恆、容量餘裕與局部熱點反例；保留所有邊界假設；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the component heat ledger, two-path reconciliation, capacity margins and a local-hotspot counterexample. Preserve all boundary assumptions so IT heat is not confused with total facility power. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 branch_id、K、pressure、flow 與最低流量；總表之外必須輸出每支路合格判定。","differenceEn":"Build branch identity, resistance, pressure, flow and minimum-flow fields. Emit branch-level acceptance alongside the total so a healthy first branch cannot conceal a starved second branch.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["固定 IT 發熱 P、液冷捕獲率 f 時，殘餘空氣熱量為 P(1-f)；f 必須按同一熱邊界定義；教學機架 IT 發熱 160 kW；液冷捕獲率由 80% 下降到 70%，不含房間其他設備；名義式 160*(1-0.8) = 32 kW air heat；變更式 160*(1-0.7) = 48 kW air heat。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","各支路 q_i=sqrt(H/K_i)，總流量為各支路相加；此式假設固定共同壓差且互連歧管損失忽略；共同壓差 16 kPa；K1=1，K2 名義 4、變更 9，K 單位 kPa/(L/min)²；名義式 sqrt(16/1)+sqrt(16/4) = 6 L/min total；變更式 sqrt(16/1)+sqrt(16/9) = 5.33333333333 L/min total。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For fixed IT heat P and liquid capture fraction f, residual air heat is P(1-f). Define both terms over the same boundary; a capture fraction for processors alone cannot represent all rack heat. A synthetic rack produces 160 kW of IT heat. Liquid capture falls from 80% to 70%, excluding other room equipment and facility losses from the stated boundary. Nominal 160*(1-0.8) = 32 kW air heat; changed 160*(1-0.7) = 48 kW air heat. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Each branch has q_i=sqrt(H/K_i), and total flow is their sum. Assume fixed common head and negligible manifold losses; do not add parallel resistances as if the branches were in series. Use common head 16 kPa, K1=1 and K2 changing from 4 to 9 in kPa/(L/min)². The primary branch remains unchanged while the second becomes more restrictive. Nominal sqrt(16/1)+sqrt(16/4) = 6 L/min total; changed sqrt(16/1)+sqrt(16/9) = 5.33333333333 L/min total. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-052","referenceUrls":["https://docs.lammps.org/latest/Howto_thermostat.html"],"title":"LAMMPS：溫控自由度與偏置速度稽核","titleEn":"LAMMPS: thermostat degrees of freedom and velocity-bias audit","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付元件熱帳本、雙路徑守恆、容量餘裕與局部熱點反例；保留所有邊界假設；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the component heat ledger, two-path reconciliation, capacity margins and a local-hotspot counterexample. Preserve all boundary assumptions so IT heat is not confused with total facility power. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"使用原創合成資料研究「LAMMPS：溫控自由度與偏置速度稽核」，從物理或資料契約推導計算，並以反例驗證。完成：交付速度與動能帳本、自由度扣除表、兩種反例與溫控設定審查紀錄。","differenceEn":"Investigate LAMMPS: thermostat degrees of freedom and velocity-bias audit using an original synthetic fixture. Derive the calculation from its physical or data contract, challenge it with a counterexample, and defend a bounded conclusion. Complete: Deliver a velocity and energy ledger, a degree-of-freedom subtraction table, two diagnostic counterexamples and a thermostat configuration review that distinguishes temperature definition from temperature regulation.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["固定 IT 發熱 P、液冷捕獲率 f 時，殘餘空氣熱量為 P(1-f)；f 必須按同一熱邊界定義；教學機架 IT 發熱 160 kW；液冷捕獲率由 80% 下降到 70%，不含房間其他設備；名義式 160*(1-0.8) = 32 kW air heat；變更式 160*(1-0.7) = 48 kW air heat。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","將已去質心的 K=18 代入公式；同時計算錯用 f=12 的結果，解釋 3 與 4 的差異源於定義。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For fixed IT heat P and liquid capture fraction f, residual air heat is P(1-f). Define both terms over the same boundary; a capture fraction for processors alone cannot represent all rack heat. A synthetic rack produces 160 kW of IT heat. Liquid capture falls from 80% to 70%, excluding other room equipment and facility losses from the stated boundary. Nominal 160*(1-0.8) = 32 kW air heat; changed 160*(1-0.7) = 48 kW air heat. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Insert unbiased K=18 into the temperature formula. Also compute the deliberately incorrect result obtained with twelve degrees of freedom and explain why the discrepancy is caused by inconsistent definitions rather than an integration failure.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-84367333215d0635","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/documents/oai-system-liquid-cooling-guidelines-in-ocp-template-mar-3-2023-update-pdf","title":"OAI System Liquid Cooling Guidelines","titleEn":"OAI System Liquid Cooling Guidelines","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-149f30495f1039d5","url":"https://docs.lammps.org/latest/Howto_thermostat.html","title":"LAMMPS thermostat guidance","titleEn":"LAMMPS thermostat guidance","publisher":"LAMMPS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
